Package: com.nextsolution.nextledger.smsdaemon
Name: Next Ledger SMS Daemon
Version: 2.0.2
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0)
Description: RootHide launch daemon that reads matching bank SMS, classifies expense, income and transfers, and records them safely in Next Ledger with a temporary diagnostic console.
Maintainer: Next Solution
Author: Zeeshan Barvi
Section: Utilities
Priority: optional
